==Russian==

===Alternative forms===
* {{alt|ru|алфави́тъ||ru-PRO}}

===Etymology===
From {{der|ru|gkm|ἀλφάβητον}}. The pronunciation with stress on the second syllable comes directly from the Greek, while the pronunciation with stress on the third syllable was altered, possibly by analogy to French, and gained prestige. Compare {{cog|uk|алфа́віт}}.

